        "issue": "When the zone stack is full (CWIKI_ZONE_MAX_DEPTH = 16), an opening brace-group is not pushed, but its closing brace still pops a zone. Brace groups alone can now reach this limit. A probe with 17 nested braces in `$\\ce{...} y$ and $w$ tail` produced one compilable inline block that ran to the end o",
